{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5ed3b53cfd4bdbef0e8ce762d612da4058424fade33b9336e5d0aa474a66522b", "ja": "（今日の『誰ソ彼ノ淵』の撮影は大分順調なようだ。\n昼の撮影はもう終わって、次の撮影は日没後か……）", "zh": "（今天《谁彼之渊》的拍摄似乎进行得相当顺利。白天的拍摄已经结束了，下一场拍摄要等到日落之后吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1254afeba4b323da10a676e42999e77eda539809a7daf4dbba2f4df1170c3145", "ja": "（突然できた空き時間、アイドル達はみんな\n思い思いに遊びに出ている……と思っていたが）", "zh": "（突然多出了空闲时间，我本以为偶像们都各自出去玩了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1003_p", "source_sha256": "524a9adcf882d48d65996412510ae3e783546ca87a2ad599c77a8a32d7fdb0e7", "ja": "どうしたんだ、伊織。暗い顔して……。\nあ、もしかして役作りか？", "zh": "怎么了，伊织？一脸闷闷不乐的……\n啊，难道是在为角色做准备？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "8c42c9dd5aa11fd40058b6e2b164594df9e36544472e228de60a44ffab80b7ba", "ja": "違うわよ！\nまあ、大したことじゃないんだけど……。", "zh": "才不是呢！嗯，也不是什么大不了的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "17f72ec333d5fbf150532b11cd7ad81e33783e4c672fc7997b98ede21441c3fc", "ja": "今日のお昼ごはん、けっこう重かったでしょ。\nそれで、なんだか……。", "zh": "今天的午饭分量挺大的吧。\n所以，总觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1006_p", "source_sha256": "186be6f3bad58061129e659eeb41fab6dcdb8fa30ea86ef53f05767219203939", "ja": "ああ、すごくおいしいハンバーグだった。\nいい肉を使ってるんだろうな。", "zh": "啊，汉堡肉真好吃。\n应该用的是上等肉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "3d8a7415875757562721c4fb3058028162326401e26436c076fb55eba7215123", "ja": "……アンタはデリカシーがないから、\n生きるのが楽そうでいいわね。", "zh": "……你这个人神经真粗，\n活得那么轻松可真好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "f473efb591ce6d189340e0cbd5789f86f94034703c83887d3c4464c7d148a7ba", "ja": "とにかく、ちょっと消化不良みたいなの。\nそれだけよ。", "zh": "总之，感觉有点消化不良。就这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ab232d7d4c76c49b96d16efeebe7dc98c86c42ce5555195a358ffaec2c3f47e3", "ja": "そうか。\n伊織は繊細なんだな……。", "zh": "这样啊。\n伊织还真是细腻啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "a89dd4396b9733c89d9c51e75d213ea3761430b3b4dbe9210c551bc0ee6163e9", "ja": "余計なことしか言えないなら黙ってなさいよ。", "zh": "如果只会说多余的话，就给我闭嘴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4e8f0c64fb1d17edc8597a06a64ed6ab0332720255f12a156f1fb106e22683dc", "ja": "ごめん、気をつける。\nけど体調が悪いなら、部屋でちゃんと休まないか？", "zh": "对不起，我会注意的。\n不过，如果身体不舒服，就回房间好好休息吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6cc1329df886f3918564f8aa5ccc02e05781ca7ade453275ff009487ffc2fe7b", "ja": "伊織の出番はあと少しだし、調整できると思う。\n薬は、スタッフさんからもらってくるよ。", "zh": "伊织的出场还要过一会儿，我想应该可以调整。  \n药我去找工作人员拿来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "e62af6181bc6881ae968453338f3334500fa35beaf09cf0b9c51b7d1e9d1150f", "ja": "ただの消化不良よ。少し休めば大丈夫。\n部屋じゃなくて、ここで休んでるわ。", "zh": "只是消化不良而已。稍微休息一下就没事了。\n我不回房间，就在这里休息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1014_p", "source_sha256": "48872af9201db3d200bcb06b8f03397d3c8daf9e771741b4e4c90400dfb7224b", "ja": "そうか。なら俺は、席を外そうか？", "zh": "这样啊。那我先回避一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "6ceb61b393241bc188a6e0c04eb11aec8a76da492ad1556848962f6145549205", "ja": "え！？　{$P$}……\nい、行かないで。", "zh": "诶！？{$P$}……\n别、别走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d91dcd955d9a05c46dff56c94a0c992334d28b1944dc642ffa9395cec0ea1841", "ja": "伊織？", "zh": "伊织？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "4c7e4d645b8ba3c5f519fcc863ceadcbd6af39681c55dffc2408ec83bdd28dcf", "ja": "た、体調が悪いと、心細くなるでしょ！\nそれに、ここでひとりになるのは怖いっていうか……。", "zh": "身、身体不舒服的时候，会觉得心里没底吧！\n而且，一个人待在这里也有点害怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "61b27027d90a0941d296f0d64f8dd97cf08ae967f1b9c5312ea6b1443694b7cd", "ja": "だから……撮影が始まるまでの間、\nアンタはそこにいて。何もしなくていいから。", "zh": "所以……在拍摄开始之前，\n你就待在那里。什么都不用做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c3338ffe7a2393d820a80f70fc4e2cdb948a97bc60561304b4c1a410217a0816", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。けど、やっぱり薬はもらってくるよ。\nすぐ戻るから、待っててくれ。", "zh": "啊，当然。不过，我还是去拿药吧。\n马上就回来，你等着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0313_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "6c6bdec51440add1dd77e1d6ebbdde3e1caad39235229277e4dbfa82128bc9ec", "ja": "わかったわ。\n……ほんと、心配性なんだから。", "zh": "知道了啦。\n……真是的，瞎操心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
